# Required. An Airtable personal access token of this app's own — not the
# guest panel's, and not the one inside the Chrome extension, which every BM
# has a copy of. Read-only is enough:
#   scopes: data.records:read, schema.bases:read
#   access: the Leatherback Bookings base only
# schema.bases:read lets the app tell an intentionally empty field apart from
# a misspelt {{placeholder}}. Without it, every blank placeholder is flagged.
AIRTABLE_API_KEY=

# Optional. These default to the base and tables the extension used.
# Airtable accepts a table name in place of its ID.
# AIRTABLE_BASE_ID=appnRSV0g89whVidp
# TABLE_BOOKINGS=tblntsVYlf0hfuWnI
# TABLE_BOOKING_CRM=tblu9Oa6PaPvj2eVJ
# TABLE_FAQ=tblkB560BHZShTJkh
# TABLE_CUSTOMERS=Customers
# AIRTABLE_CUSTOMERS_EMAIL_FIELD=Client Email
